        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;imt_core::plugin: a Plugin registers contributions in the PluginRegistry, which wraps each one in a Guarded* adapter. Isolated built-ins run out of process behind RemotePlugin (gRPC imt.plugin.v1).&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C400%3B0%2C700%3B1%2C400%26display%3Dblock;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1100" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
